  "description": ".NET client library for the ID Analyzer API v2. Scan and validate driver license, passport and ID card from any country, perform face/liveness biometric verification, AML/PEP screening, DocuPass remote verification and e-signature, KYC profile management and contract generation. Targets the api2.idanalyzer.com fleet.",
